# Zurculous 2 — derived from game source (game.aslx).
# No published walkthrough. Ending "End Chapter 2": the only non-death terminal
# page (cliffhanger that brings Demon Lord Malich back). Path prefers Shout and
# FireOnRoad for better health; LetUsFightToTheDeath over BegForYourLife (beheading).
# The ending never calls finish, so the script ends with the game's own quit.
go Stay Here
go Shout
go DarkRoom
go CarlonThrone
go LetUsFightToTheDeath
go Mainroad
go SmallForrestRoadHeadingSouth
go FireOnRoad
go BorderIntoTheSouth
go Grab Sword
go End Chapter 2
quit
